READING: if the covering-min DESCENDS toward 1/14 as speeds grow, the covering branch is also
'barely true' and uniform looseness (HYP-2566) is the crux. If it PLATEAUS above 1/14, a margin
argument suffices there and LRC(14) = [tau=1/q witness on non-covering] + [margin on covering].
